{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026r4socWHQNd1793273064.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港公開羽毛球錦標賽，下月首度移師啟德上演。</p><p></p><p>香港賽是年終賽前巡迴賽壓軸一站，屬超級500賽事，總獎金50萬美元，即接近400萬港元。港隊謝影雪，將改拍17歲小將，前國手龔睿娜的兒子禹智睿出戰混雙，她希望將經驗傳授給對方。</p><p></p><p>賽事下月17至22日，首度移師啟德體藝館上演。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:53.040143+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:27:15.768733+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:23.329408+00:00","content_hash":"7ec68a7b7a892784be36b0c768d746f42bbd227fb5f7375f6c2cffc2f0648df3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:53.040143+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}